<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - California Dept of Wtr Resources.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - California Dept of Wtr Resources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc said it priced $20.700 million of California Dept of Water Resources, taxable weekly variable rate bonds, with a top yield of 5.35 percent in 2024.</p>
</text>
